1
00:00:00,530 --> 00:00:01,730
Twenty-seven students.

2
00:00:01,730 --> 00:00:02,850
One exam link.

3
00:00:02,850 --> 00:00:04,610
Anti-cheating switched on.

4
00:00:04,610 --> 00:00:07,090
And every result back on your screen

5
00:00:07,090 --> 00:00:08,290
automatically.

6
00:00:08,290 --> 00:00:11,090
Let's run a real online exam on TestoZa,

7
00:00:11,090 --> 00:00:12,116
start to finish.

8
00:00:14,466 --> 00:00:15,426
Here's my test

9
00:00:15,426 --> 00:00:19,106
the JEE Main mini mock we built in the last video.

10
00:00:19,106 --> 00:00:22,504
To run it as a real exam, click Conduct exam.

11
00:00:22,674 --> 00:00:26,194
TestoZa creates a private, secure link just for this exam.

12
00:00:26,194 --> 00:00:27,794
It never shows up publicly

13
00:00:27,794 --> 00:00:29,874
only people with this link can open it.

14
00:00:29,874 --> 00:00:30,834
Start Conducting…

15
00:00:30,834 --> 00:00:32,264
and your exam is live.

16
00:00:32,434 --> 00:00:33,794
See this little guide?

17
00:00:33,794 --> 00:00:35,874
TestoZa walks you through it.

18
00:00:35,874 --> 00:00:38,514
Step one: set up the exam room.

19
00:00:38,514 --> 00:00:40,041
Let's open Settings.

20
00:00:40,211 --> 00:00:41,811
This is your exam room.

21
00:00:41,811 --> 00:00:44,851
Three tabs: Proctoring, Access, and Results.

22
00:00:44,851 --> 00:00:47,971
I'll go through every switch, the way I'd set it up for

23
00:00:47,971 --> 00:00:48,846
a real exam.

24
00:00:49,016 --> 00:00:49,816
First

25
00:00:49,816 --> 00:00:51,336
Force Full Screen.

26
00:00:51,336 --> 00:00:54,696
The exam opens full screen, and if a student leaves it,

27
00:00:54,696 --> 00:00:56,776
that's counted as a violation.

28
00:00:56,776 --> 00:00:59,335
For any serious test, switch this on.

29
00:00:59,505 --> 00:01:02,545
Next, Tab and App Switch Detection.

30
00:01:02,545 --> 00:01:05,185
Opening another tab, jumping to WhatsApp,

31
00:01:05,185 --> 00:01:06,545
minimising the browser

32
00:01:06,545 --> 00:01:08,484
TestoZa catches all of it.

33
00:01:08,894 --> 00:01:11,694
Now decide what happens when they do.

34
00:01:11,694 --> 00:01:12,814
Warn only

35
00:01:12,814 --> 00:01:14,734
fine for a practice test.

36
00:01:14,734 --> 00:01:15,614
Strict

37
00:01:15,614 --> 00:01:18,334
the test submits on the very first switch.

38
00:01:18,334 --> 00:01:21,294
Or my favourite: give a few warnings,

39
00:01:21,294 --> 00:01:22,414
then submit.

40
00:01:22,414 --> 00:01:23,614
Three is fair.

41
00:01:23,614 --> 00:01:26,254
One notification can pop up by accident

42
00:01:26,254 --> 00:01:27,774
three times is a habit.

43
00:01:27,774 --> 00:01:30,766
And full-screen exits count toward the same limit.

44
00:01:30,936 --> 00:01:32,456
Disable Copy-Paste

45
00:01:32,456 --> 00:01:36,136
so nobody pastes your question into Google or ChatGPT.

46
00:01:36,136 --> 00:01:37,656
Disable Right Click

47
00:01:37,656 --> 00:01:40,565
no menu, no quick search, no translate.

48
00:01:40,815 --> 00:01:43,695
Block Back Button stops a student leaving the exam by

49
00:01:43,695 --> 00:01:44,255
accident.

50
00:01:44,255 --> 00:01:46,655
And Disable Exit Button hides the exit,

51
00:01:46,655 --> 00:01:48,535
so nobody walks out halfway.

52
00:01:48,705 --> 00:01:51,162
Second tab: Access and Control.

53
00:01:51,412 --> 00:01:54,292
Scheduled Access opens and closes the exam at times you

54
00:01:54,292 --> 00:01:54,852
choose

55
00:01:54,852 --> 00:01:57,412
perfect when the whole batch must start together.

56
00:01:57,412 --> 00:01:59,619
We're starting right now, so I'll leave it off.

57
00:01:59,869 --> 00:02:02,589
Assign to Class keeps this exam's results with the right

58
00:02:02,589 --> 00:02:03,309
batch.

59
00:02:03,309 --> 00:02:04,269
Attempt Limit

60
00:02:04,269 --> 00:02:06,109
one exam, one attempt.

61
00:02:06,109 --> 00:02:08,509
No retakes after seeing the paper.

62
00:02:08,509 --> 00:02:11,789
And Require Candidate Login stays off for a class test.

63
00:02:11,789 --> 00:02:14,429
Students just open the link, type their name,

64
00:02:14,429 --> 00:02:15,309
and start.

65
00:02:15,309 --> 00:02:16,029
No accounts.

66
00:02:16,029 --> 00:02:16,840
No app.

67
00:02:17,010 --> 00:02:19,129
Last tab: Results and Timing.

68
00:02:19,379 --> 00:02:20,659
Result Visibility

69
00:02:20,659 --> 00:02:24,099
on, and students see their score and analysis the moment

70
00:02:24,099 --> 00:02:24,979
they submit.

71
00:02:24,979 --> 00:02:27,571
Turn it off if you'd rather announce results later.

72
00:02:27,741 --> 00:02:29,661
Strict Timer runs on our server.

73
00:02:29,661 --> 00:02:31,581
Refresh the page, close the browser

74
00:02:31,581 --> 00:02:33,181
the clock keeps running.

75
00:02:33,181 --> 00:02:34,897
Always on, for real exams.

76
00:02:35,067 --> 00:02:38,427
Allow Flexible Timer lets students switch the timer off.

77
00:02:38,427 --> 00:02:39,547
Great for practice

78
00:02:39,547 --> 00:02:41,547
and TestoZa even warns you

79
00:02:41,547 --> 00:02:43,563
but for an exam, keep it off.

80
00:02:43,733 --> 00:02:47,493
Randomize Questions gives every student a different order

81
00:02:47,493 --> 00:02:49,965
so the person sitting next to them can't help.

82
00:02:50,135 --> 00:02:52,855
And finally, the exam screen itself.

83
00:02:52,855 --> 00:02:56,535
Standard Mode looks just like the JEE and NEET computer-based

84
00:02:56,535 --> 00:02:59,175
test, with a question palette on the right.

85
00:02:59,175 --> 00:03:02,455
Modern Mode is a clean, one-card-at-a-time layout.

86
00:03:02,455 --> 00:03:04,898
For exam practice, I keep Standard.

87
00:03:05,228 --> 00:03:06,508
Save Settings…

88
00:03:06,508 --> 00:03:07,388
and look

89
00:03:07,388 --> 00:03:10,028
the "Anti-cheating is off" warning is gone.

90
00:03:10,028 --> 00:03:12,034
Your exam room is locked.

91
00:03:12,204 --> 00:03:12,604
Now

92
00:03:12,604 --> 00:03:13,884
who's writing?

93
00:03:13,884 --> 00:03:15,804
These are your candidate inputs.

94
00:03:15,804 --> 00:03:17,164
Name is already there.

95
00:03:17,164 --> 00:03:20,044
Tap Roll No, and every result comes with a name and a

96
00:03:20,044 --> 00:03:20,781
roll number.

97
00:03:20,951 --> 00:03:22,551
Step two: send it.

98
00:03:22,551 --> 00:03:23,431
Copy the link…

99
00:03:23,431 --> 00:03:25,942
or share it straight to your class WhatsApp group.

100
00:03:27,252 --> 00:03:29,012
TestoZa writes the message for you

101
00:03:29,012 --> 00:03:33,320
exam name, time, the link, and simple instructions.

102
00:03:33,320 --> 00:03:33,914
Send.

103
00:03:35,264 --> 00:03:37,664
Not everyone's on WhatsApp

104
00:03:37,664 --> 00:03:40,224
and sometimes you're standing in a classroom.

105
00:03:40,224 --> 00:03:42,784
Open the menu, get a join code…

106
00:03:42,784 --> 00:03:43,904
and there it is.

107
00:03:43,904 --> 00:03:45,077
Six digits.

108
00:03:46,264 --> 00:03:49,464
Write it on the board: testoza.com slash join…

109
00:03:49,464 --> 00:03:50,269
and the code.

110
00:03:52,279 --> 00:03:53,879
Now, the student's side.

111
00:03:53,879 --> 00:03:55,799
The message lands in the class group.

112
00:03:55,799 --> 00:03:56,719
One tap…

113
00:03:57,719 --> 00:04:00,039
and the exam opens right in the browser.

114
00:04:00,039 --> 00:04:01,799
No app, no sign-up.

115
00:04:01,799 --> 00:04:04,439
They see the paper, the time and the marks…

116
00:04:04,439 --> 00:04:06,119
type their name and roll number…

117
00:04:06,119 --> 00:04:07,207
and tap Start.

118
00:04:09,419 --> 00:04:10,299
No phone?

119
00:04:10,299 --> 00:04:11,099
No problem.

120
00:04:11,099 --> 00:04:12,059
Any browser

121
00:04:12,059 --> 00:04:14,219
testoza.com slash join

122
00:04:14,219 --> 00:04:15,979
type the six digits from the board…

123
00:04:15,979 --> 00:04:16,968
and they're in.

124
00:04:17,138 --> 00:04:18,898
Same exam, same rules.

125
00:04:18,898 --> 00:04:20,338
Name, roll number…

126
00:04:20,338 --> 00:04:21,218
Start.

127
00:04:21,218 --> 00:04:23,618
Full screen kicks in, the timer starts,

128
00:04:23,618 --> 00:04:25,841
and they answer like any computer-based test.

129
00:04:26,011 --> 00:04:28,171
And if they try to sneak into another tab?

130
00:04:28,171 --> 00:04:29,371
Warning one of three.

131
00:04:29,371 --> 00:04:30,651
TestoZa saw it

132
00:04:30,651 --> 00:04:31,710
and counted it.

133
00:04:31,880 --> 00:04:32,840
When they're done

134
00:04:32,840 --> 00:04:33,560
Submit.

135
00:04:33,560 --> 00:04:36,982
Result Visibility is on, so they see their score instantly.

136
00:04:37,986 --> 00:04:39,906
Meanwhile, on your dashboard

137
00:04:39,906 --> 00:04:41,986
twenty-five students writing right now,

138
00:04:41,986 --> 00:04:43,506
two already submitted.

139
00:04:43,506 --> 00:04:45,944
You're watching the whole exam, live.

140
00:04:46,114 --> 00:04:48,674
Open Results: twenty-seven started,

141
00:04:48,674 --> 00:04:50,914
twenty-five writing, two submitted,

142
00:04:50,914 --> 00:04:52,194
zero dropped.

143
00:04:52,194 --> 00:04:54,434
Every student, by name and roll number,

144
00:04:54,434 --> 00:04:55,522
as it happens.

145
00:04:55,692 --> 00:04:57,132
When the exam ends

146
00:04:57,132 --> 00:04:59,532
all twenty-seven submitted, scored,

147
00:04:59,532 --> 00:05:00,572
and ranked.

148
00:05:00,572 --> 00:05:01,852
Automatically.

149
00:05:01,852 --> 00:05:03,372
No checking copies.

150
00:05:03,372 --> 00:05:04,732
No totalling marks.

151
00:05:04,732 --> 00:05:07,219
And one click exports everything to Excel.

152
00:05:08,219 --> 00:05:09,739
That's TestoZa.

153
00:05:09,739 --> 00:05:11,659
A paper that used to mean printing,

154
00:05:11,659 --> 00:05:14,139
invigilating, and a weekend of checking

155
00:05:14,139 --> 00:05:17,207
now runs on the phones your students already carry.

156
00:05:20,999 --> 00:05:23,319
And exams are going digital.

157
00:05:23,319 --> 00:05:27,079
The Education Ministry has announced that NEET-UG is set

158
00:05:27,079 --> 00:05:30,279
to move to computer-based testing from 2027.

159
00:05:30,279 --> 00:05:33,094
Let your students practise the way they'll be tested.

160
00:05:34,744 --> 00:05:38,184
Make your test, conduct it free, and see every result

161
00:05:38,184 --> 00:05:38,824
in minutes

162
00:05:38,824 --> 00:05:40,744
at testoza.com.

163
00:05:40,744 --> 00:05:41,864
Thanks for watching

164
00:05:41,864 --> 00:05:44,244
subscribe, and I'll see you in the next one.
